            - **Snapshot File:** `public/data/gems-history/${{ steps.date.outputs.month }}.json`
            - **Updated State:** `public/data/gems.json`

            All test suites passed. Please review any status transitions (e.g. `pending-review` or `below-threshold`) before merging.
